      <Positioned left="48" top="170" width="1056" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="滤镜分两类：ImageFiltered 模糊子树自身，BackdropFilter 模糊身后背景。"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="48" top="204" width="1056" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="两者目前只构造高斯模糊，sigma 必须是有限非负数，tileMode 默认 CLAMP。"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="48" top="238" width="1056" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="交付前必须真的打开图片逐张检查，并保留同名 .snapshot 与过程日志。"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="48" top="282" width="5" height="26"><Container color="#2563EB" borderRadius="3"/></Positioned>
