      <Positioned left="540" top="320" width="612" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="彩条是背景；玻璃面板用"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="540" top="354" width="612" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="BackdropFilter 糊它身后的彩条。"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="540" top="388" width="612" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="下方左实心、右模糊，展示"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="540" top="422" width="612" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#1F2937" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="ImageFiltered 只作用于子树。"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="540" top="466" width="612" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#475569" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="顶部彩条：供背景滤镜取样。"/></Positioned>
      <Positioned left="540" top="500" width="612" height="56"><Text fontSize="24" color="#475569" fontFamily="Noto Sans CJK SC" text="玻璃面板：BackdropFilter 糊身后。"/></Positioned>
